# Copy to .env.local to configure "Generate with AI".
#
# You have TWO ways to authenticate — pick either:
#
#   1. API key (billed usage). Get one at https://console.anthropic.com/.
#      It stays server-side (never shipped to the browser).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
#
#   2. Claude Code (your Pro/Max subscription). Leave ANTHROPIC_API_KEY blank,
#      install the `claude` CLI and log in (`claude login`). Generation then
#      runs through your subscription instead of billed API usage — no key needed.
#
# Provider selection (optional). Default "auto": use the API key if set,
# otherwise fall back to Claude Code. Force one with: api | claude-code
# DECK_AI_PROVIDER=

# Optional: override the Chromium binary used for PDF export.
# Defaults to /opt/pw-browsers/chromium, else Playwright's bundled browser.
# PLAYWRIGHT_CHROMIUM_PATH=
